# FingerHealthScan

AI-assisted finger health screening application.

## Features

- Finger camera scanning
- Heart rate measurement
- Pulse waveform
- HRV estimation
- Respiratory rate estimation
- Scan quality analysis
- Health results dashboard

## Important

This application is a screening/research tool and does not replace
professional medical testing or diagnosis.

Blood parameters such as RBC, WBC, platelets, cholesterol and glucose
require appropriate medical testing equipment and are not directly
measured by a normal smartphone camera.
